d: more than half of the works published 2024 have no citations so far. This is expected for recent works and is not a sign of low quality.","Mean versus median: the mean is above the median in 4 of 4 years, because a few highly cited works pull the average up. The widest gap is 2022: mean 3.6, median 2, top work 9. The median is the better guide to a typical work.","Recent years: works from 2024 have had less than three years to be cited, so their values will rise.","Small base: the values for 2019–2022 and 2024 are based on only 10–29 works (lighter box or hollow point), so read them with care.","Few works: 2023 and 2025–2026 have fewer than 10 works (2023: 2, 2025: 6, 2026: 3), too few for a band. Each of those works is drawn as a dot."]}}}